# Round 80: two holes in the round-79 hoist. A bound above LONG_MAX:
# (long)ceil(1e19) is UB (LLONG_MIN on x86-64) and the round-79
# negative-clamp LAUNDERED the overflow sentinel into an empty loop
# -- VM dies out of range, AOT printed 0, rc 0. The bound is now
# tested AS A DOUBLE (> 0 && <= 9.2e18) before any cast; an
# unrepresentable bound takes the scalar branch, which dies
# byte-exactly. _err class: both die, equal codes. (These raise
# sites also gained the 'Error line N:' frame the VM prints -- the
# bare fprintf form failed normalization on the prefix alone.)
b is buffer of 4
i is 0
loop while i < 1e19:
    b[i] is 1
    i is i + 1
print of i
print of b[0]
